WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.890
You're close, really close...

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:05.600
You really shouldn't get so close!

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.460
I'm telling you, it's wrong!

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.100
My precious maiden will be 12 forever!

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.130
Ryuunosuke-kun's criminal mind has led his heart astray.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.500
I must do something for him.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.100
Thank you for opening my eyes!

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.280
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.930
My precious maiden was you all along.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.370
Come, let us have our picture taken by the innkeeper in front of her inn!

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:31.940
This is it! I know it!

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.720
I'm so inspired!!

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.250
So this is it...

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.900
The love potion developed through the diligent labors of the Hououin clan!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.940
It is made to resemble the flavor of
a popular healthy vegetable juice drink.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:44.310
Nin

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.270
Whoever drinks it will fall hopelessly
in love with the first person they see.
Nin

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.880
Please use it on the one so dear to your heart, young master.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:53.530
Once my dear maiden drinks this...

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.700
Now our love will last forever,
my dear maiden.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.880
Yes...

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.510
And once we've taken the
"princess carrying" photo...!

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:04.490
Young master. Young master! Young master!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.640
As I have told you many times,
the effects will wear off at sunset.

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:12.600
"Only" until sunset?
That's plenty of time for me.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.050
"L...Love potion"?!

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:48.930
The Alluring Double Adultery!?
School Trip to the West...

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:53.140
School Trip to the West...
The Alluring Double Adultery!?
The Alluring Double Adultery!?
School Trip to the West...

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:53.210
School Trip to the West...
The Alluring Double Adultery!?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:57.040
Maybe Iwaki-kun and his friends have already left for Harborland...

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.690
I'd better hurry after them.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:04.010
Okay! Is everybody here?

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.720
Yeah! It's my first trip to Toudaiji
with my husband!

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.510
Ah, such a coincidence.
Are you also going to Toudaiji?

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:11.880
Dannosuke-kun!

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.470
Can't you ever make a <i>normal</i>  appearance?

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:18.630
How about some nice, healthy vegetable juice,
my precious maiden?

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:21.690
Pardon meeee!!

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.140
Someone pushed me.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.530
Are you all right, Aoi-chan?

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:30.970
So big!

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.120
My precious maiden,

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:37.500
perhaps you would enjoy some vegetable juice while meditating on the Great Buddha?

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.020
Ah, I've been standing too long~

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.800
Keinosuke-kun, you look good with her!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.980
Uh, no...

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.370
Have they already headed off to the old foreigners' district?

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.770
I've got rice cakes for the deer.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.960
Thank you, Darling!

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.400
Ah! The deer!

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:58.890
My dear maiden!

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.480
Yes, Shikanosuke-kun?

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:04.070
Here's a special vegetable juice that goes well with those rice crackers.

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.820
You idiot!

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.290
Those aren't for human consum-

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.240
Why're you eating that?!

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:14.010
I'm not supposed to?

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:16.580
My sweet honey,
use this to cleanse your palate.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.900
Oh, my! Look how many rice cakes I bought!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.420
That's incredible, Aoi-chan!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.020
Oops! I dropped them all...

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:27.930
What's with her?

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:30.890
DEER!!!

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:32.870
So many deer! Yay!!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.500
Eek! Ooh, that tickles!!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:38.440
Whoa! Rizel!!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:38.970
My dear maiden!!
Whoa! Rizel!!

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:39.980
My dear maiden!!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.560
I wonder what souvenirs
I should get for my honey...

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:48.510
Hey, this juice brand is named "Nacchan," just like me!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.330
But why'd it fall from the sky? Oh, well!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.120
Oh, no! Sensei drank it!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.750
Man, that was rough.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.210
Wait, where's Rizel?!

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:05.120
Hang in there, Sensei!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.240
What happened?!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.990
Iwaki-kun! Sensei has-!

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:11.500
For now, I'll take her back to the bus
so she can get some rest.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.150
Iwaki-kun!

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:14.270
It's gone, it's gone!

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.250
Where could I have dropped it?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.800
After we finally managed
to develop a love potion...

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:23.600
Young master!  I thought this might happen, so I prepared another bottle.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.060
Way to go, Old Man!

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:28.650
No way! A second bottle?!

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:30.360
Darling!

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:32.430
Where are you??

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.850
My precious maiden!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:37.160
Oh, Sanosuke-kun! Do you know where my husband is?

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.870
I'll help you look for him.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.400
But first, drink this
to help settle your nerves.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.850
Thanks!

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.170
Don't drink it! Whoa-

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.310
This hour has come at last!
Finally, my dear maiden truly is mine!

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.730
She drank it!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.930
Open your eyes, my precious maiden...

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.640
Gaze upon me before anyone else,
and love only me!

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.080
Huh...?

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.570
Do you know who I am, my dear maiden?

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.590
Yes, Darling.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.950
Oh, sweet music to my ears.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.140
I love you, Darling.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:17.750
Oh, how fabulous!! And Iwaki-kun felt this supreme bliss every day!

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.410
It can't be!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.010
My sweet honey...

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.640
Yes, Darling?

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:27.130
Ahem, as your... h-husband, can you grant me a wish?

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.410
Yes, anything!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.410
Sh-Show me your... bear-print panties!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:33.250
That's so very embarrassing!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.420
Was that an unreasonable request?

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:37.420
But if it's for my husband...

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.050
Eh?! S-So you'll do it?

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.390
Yes.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.560
I saw them! The real deal!!

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.480
I knew it! I feel so embarrassed!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.660
Will you show me one more time?

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.610
There they are!!

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.230
No!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.350
One more time!
No!

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.210
Oh yeah!

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:03.320
Can't watch!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:06.410
Ryuunosuke-kun is about to be
corrupted beyond recognition!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.380
NOOO!!

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.040
Well then... my next request...

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.430
Sensei! Are you okay, Sensei?

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.850
Iwaki...-kun...

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.220
Thank goodness!

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.870
I feel kind of... warm...

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:28.890
I'm <i>hot.</i>

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.370
If you're going to change, I'll step outside.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.630
Take the rest of them off for me, Iwaki-kun.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.330
S-Sensei-!!

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.790
It's so hard to do it myself...

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.340
C-Come on, snap out of it!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:57.560
Come on, Iwaki-kun... You've always been looking at me, haven't you?

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.180
I know you have.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.930
Sensei...

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:04.440
W-What's <i>wrong</i>  with you?!
You're acting really weird, Sensei!

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.600
And who do you think
is making me act this way?

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.330
S-Sensei... you're already married!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.310
So are you, you know...

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.080
I... I'm...

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:21.450
You know you can't resist me,
so just stop protesting.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.200
Tomonori.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.170
Ah! S-Sorry!

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:40.680
Look what you're making
a married woman do, you naughty boy.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:44.140
I'll show you a married woman's technique.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.920
Uh... Sensei!!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.400
Oh, my... It's such a mess...

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:52.080
Boys should always be lively and wild...

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.260
Oh, shit...!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.870
I might not be able to control myself,
and neither will Sensei...!

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.200
It was starting to get torn here.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.660
Married women have superb sewing skills.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:12.170
And now it's time for
some nighttime techniques...

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.510
Iwaki-kun! Rizel-chan was-!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.210
T-This isn't what you think, Seimoto!!

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.840
I know! Sensei isn't
her usual self right now!

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.390
She swallowed it!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:26.340
No I haven't. At least not <i>yet.</i>
Right, Iwaki-kun?

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.140
W-What are you talking about?!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:29.240
A love potion!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:32.910
Ryuunosuke-kun had a love potion created,
and Sensei drank it!

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.860
And just now, he made
Rizel-chan drink one, too!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.220
What?!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.700
And now, Ryuunosuke-kun
and Rizel-chan are...

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.910
I can't say it!

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.570
What?!

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.700
RIZEL!!!

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:48.440
Rizel!

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:53.310
Hououin! We all know about
your messed-up drug!

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.550
You're too late, Iwaki-kun!

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:01.620
My precious maiden's
body and soul are now mine!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.710
What?!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.510
My dear maiden.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.430
Yes, my husband?

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.850
"My husband"?!

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:13.710
Take a good look, and accept
the reality of our love!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.720
Must I do it again, Darling?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:16.750
Yes.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:19.240
I can't! My hips are all worn out...

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:21.460
Y-You've already done "that"!?

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:23.190
No...

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:26.450
Sensei is here to comfort you, Iwaki-kun!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.940
Now, my dear maiden...

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.750
All right, Darling.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:35.130
STOP!!

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:39.330
I can look at her bear-print panties
as much as I like!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:42.410
From below, above,
the right, <i>and</i>  the left...

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.130
I can look at her bear-print panties
as much as I want! <i>As much as I want!!</i>

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:48.920
Darling, my waist gets sore
if I stay in this pose too long!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.190
My life is now complete!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:53.100
How do you figure that?

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.440
Do you understand, Iwaki-kun?!

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.210
What are you laughing about, Maniasuke-kun?

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:03.200
Ah! Darling!

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.910
Oh no! The potion only lasts until sunset!

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.650
What was I doing...?

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.530
What were you hoping to accomplish, anyway?

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:16.550
Oh, no! The "princess carrying" photo!!

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.850
Let's go back, Rizel.

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.550
Okay!

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.380
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:24.920
Why am I all undressed like this in front of my students?

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:26.780
Come on, don't stick so close to me!

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:27.660
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.710
So, neither of you remember anything?

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:31.210
Huh?

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.210
Like what?
Huh?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.490
Oh, well, er...
You know... back there...

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.040
What do you mean, Iwaki-kun?

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.000
Nothing!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:42.840
Iwaki-kun! Don't go
wandering around half-dressed!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.240
Oh! How forward of you, Darling!

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.470
Darling, what is this?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.020
T-T-That's...

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.500
Have you been unfaithful to me?

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.480
N-N-No, of course not, Rizel!

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.280
Now don't go having an affair, Iwaki-kun!

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:59.030
Race you to the bus!

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.340
H-Hey! Wait, Sen-

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:01.110
Darling...
H-Hey! Wait, Sen-

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:01.920
Darling...

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.540
Darling is....

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.180
D-Don't cry! It's all a misunderstanding!

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:06.820
...cheating on me!!!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:09.000
Don't cry, Rizel!!
...cheating on me!!!

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:13.140
Ryuunosuke-kun! Ryuunosuke-kun!
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.340
"It" was stolen, you say?

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:19.900
Yes. They say that the thief was
an incredibly strong girl in glasses.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.240
It couldn't be!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.360
Iwaki-kun's nowhere to be found!

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:28.230
They were scheduled to tour the residences of the earliest settlers of Kobe today...

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:31.450
Oh, no! The second day was Nara;
Kobe is <i>tomorrow's</i>  stop!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:34.090
No way!!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.220
Hello! I'm Kyouko.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.090
There's only one day left in the school trip.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.520
I must find a way to capture
Iwaki-kun's heart, no matter what!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.830
Once it's in my hand,
I'll hold it tight and stroke it.
He'll really like that.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:20.420
Ah... am I actually a Spartan woman?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:23.840
The Alluring Battle Swapping!?
School Trip to the West...
Ah... am I actually a Spartan woman?

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.210
H-Hello! I'm Kyouko.

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.640
We're finally down to
the last day of the field trip.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.550
I haven't coaxed Iwaki-kun into my arms yet.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:38.200
If only I could at least touch his-

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.330
What am I saying?!

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.390
Now to express my confused emotions in verse:

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:46.790
There before my eyes,
A strong and handsome young boy.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:49.340
If I were to pin and hold him down,
Would that be a crime?

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:53.010
Ahh... a pure maiden's heart
is filled with longing...
